Brainfuck program to print "こんにちは世界" (Hello World in Japanese)
This program outputs UTF-8 encoded Japanese characters using only the 8 Brainfuck commands
Commands: > < + - . , [ ]

UTF-8 byte sequences needed:
  こ = 227 129 147
  ん = 227 130 147
  に = 227 129 171
  ち = 227 129 161
  は = 227 129 175
  世 = 228 184 150
  界 = 231 149 140

